#: ../../source/guide/kernels.md:1 99080548b7a54b048850c00e68067d32
msgid "SPICE 内核"
msgstr "SPICE Kernels"

#: ../../source/guide/kernels.md:3 5f70d4f291864d0dbe3755b36ccbfc6e
msgid ""
"星历动力学（轨道设计的星历修正、轨道保持等）需要 NASA SPICE 内核文件； 必需内核包括行星历（`.bsp`，如 "
"`de440.bsp`）与闰秒（`.tls`，如 `naif0012.tls`）。"
msgstr "Ephemeris dynamics (ephemeris correction in orbit design, station keeping, …) requires NASA SPICE kernel files; the required kernels include the planetary ephemeris (`.bsp`, e.g. `de440.bsp`) and leap seconds (`.tls`, e.g. `naif0012.tls`)."

#: ../../source/guide/kernels.md:7 9516bef0d0c347988d1e37a2cd1b1160
msgid ""
"**v4.0.0 的界面工具不需要内核**：轨道族生成与轨道库浏览是纯 CR3BP 计算， "
"安装后直接使用，无任何内核准备步骤。星历类工具的界面回归见 [issue "
"#398](https://github.com/cislunarspace/transfer-orbit-design/issues/398)。"
msgstr "**The v4.0.0 UI tools need no kernels**: orbit family generation and catalog browsing are pure CR3BP computations — ready to use right after install, with no kernel preparation step. The return of ephemeris tools is tracked in [issue #398](https://github.com/cislunarspace/transfer-orbit-design/issues/398)."

#: ../../source/guide/kernels.md:11 0d7b3bb5077d405cac5c877dc89792e9
msgid "内核从哪里来"
msgstr "Where the Kernels Come From"

#: ../../source/guide/kernels.md:13 57a0bf5ba4e34f0c83aebfc8ddb8e91b
msgid ""
"安装包已随带小内核（`.bpc` / `.tls` / `.tpc` / `.tf`，位于安装目录的 "
"`resources/kernels/`）；体积大的星历 `.bsp` 不随包分发，需要时获取："
msgstr "The installer bundles the small kernels (`.bpc` / `.tls` / `.tpc` / `.tf`, under `resources/kernels/` in the install directory); the bulky ephemeris `.bsp` files are not distributed with the package — fetch them when needed:"

#: ../../source/guide/kernels.md:16 4fe4a7892aa34c908c3233d3fb5a7f32
msgid ""
"**自动下载（推荐）**：`uv run python scripts/download_kernels.py`，幂等地 拉取全部内核到 "
"`kernels/`；"
msgstr "**Automatic download (recommended)**: `uv run python scripts/download_kernels.py` — idempotently fetches all kernels into `kernels/`;"

#: ../../source/guide/kernels.md:18 108c9a42772e4ad68d21a2caffa507e5
msgid ""
"**手动下载**：从 e2m2e 的 [`kernels-v1` "
"release](https://github.com/cislunarspace/e2m2e/releases) 下载解压到 sidecar "
"工作目录下的 `kernels/`（开发期即仓库根 `kernels/`， 安装版即安装目录）；"
msgstr "**Manual download**: extract e2m2e's [`kernels-v1` release](https://github.com/cislunarspace/e2m2e/releases) into `kernels/` under the sidecar working directory (the repo root in development, the install directory for the packaged app);"

#: ../../source/guide/kernels.md:22 e0544b167daf40d5bdefdaf42e3dd0c2
msgid "**自备数据**：将 `$SPICE_KERNEL_DIR` 指向已有内核目录（优先级最高，sidecar 进程继承该环境变量）。"
msgstr "**Bring your own**: point `$SPICE_KERNEL_DIR` at an existing kernel directory (highest priority; the sidecar process inherits the variable)."

#: ../../source/guide/kernels.md:25 b6a13de06d204c67ba4bac6294988411
msgid "官方来源：[NASA NAIF](https://naif.jpl.nasa.gov/naif/data.html)（备用）。"
msgstr "Official source: [NASA NAIF](https://naif.jpl.nasa.gov/naif/data.html) (fallback)."

#: ../../source/guide/kernels.md:27 0b0f1e13b2e84228b3f9f37fc307276b
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "FAQ"

#: ../../source/guide/kernels.md:29 b7143b396baf41d5a854e83eb22cf527
msgid ""
"**报 \"SPICE(NOLEAPSECONDS)\"**：闰秒内核未加载。确保内核目录含 `naif0012.tls`，或设置 "
"`$SPICE_KERNEL_DIR` 后重启应用。"
msgstr "**\"SPICE(NOLEAPSECONDS)\" error**: the leap-second kernel is not loaded. Make sure the kernel directory contains `naif0012.tls`, or set `$SPICE_KERNEL_DIR` and restart the app."

#: ../../source/guide/kernels.md:31 caec4eac8cba4965875bff068a0906c1
msgid "**v3.2.3 及更早版本的 GUI 内核自动引导弹窗已随 PyQt UI 移除**；v4.x 星历 工具回归时会重新评估引导交互。"
msgstr "**The GUI kernel-guidance popup of v3.2.3 and earlier was removed with the PyQt UI**; the guidance interaction will be re-evaluated when ephemeris tools return in v4.x."

